{"school":{"dbn":"11X481","name":"The STEAM Bridge School","boro":"Bronx","district":"11","district_label":"District 11","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EC|EMS","school_type":"Elementary","grades":"K-5","status":"open","enrollment":272,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"1684 WHITE PLAINS ROAD, BRONX, NY 10462","phone":"718-239-5660","website":"THESTEAMBRIDGESCHOOL.ORG","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/kindergarten/69135","accessibility":"Not Accessible","overview":"We believe and inspire to create an educational atmosphere for ALL students to engage in curricula that embeds discourse, multi-facet engagement, differentiated instruction, and rigorous opportunities within the learning. \n\n*Discourse \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0093 Having significant communication skills is critical, valuable in the workplace and in our lives. Having collaborative discussion will allow our students to work together on existing and new ideas/inquiry, which will provide opportunities for input and feedback. As a result, our students will assume shared responsibilities and contribute to accomplishing common goals in meaningful and respectful ways. \n\n*Multi-Facet Engagement- Students show their thinking and learning in a creative and expressive manner. The teacher plays the role of a facilitator as students take ownership of their learning. Students use accountable talk, academic vocabulary, to challenge one another\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s thinking. Through daily problem solving, synthesizing of information and exploration, students will experience learning in new and remarkable ways. \n\n*Differentiated instruction \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0093 Each student has a unique learning style and interest. We provide students with varying avenues and opportunities for learning. Through continuous data driven instruction, we address various learning needs and develop personalized instruction so that ALL students can learn effectively. \n\n*Rigorous Opportunities \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0093 By providing a set of intentionally aligned components, we create learning outcomes that offer engaging experiences and instructional strategies into an organized sequential unit of study. This serves as a road map to high quality teaching and learning.","start_time":"8:00 AM","end_time":"2:20 PM","languages":null,"subway":"2, 5 to Bronx Park East","bus":"Bx21, Bx22, Bx36, Bx39, Bx40, Bx42, Bx4A, BxM10, BxM6","shared_building":"0","neighborhood":null,"latitude":40.84348,"longitude":-73.865113,"coordinate_source":"geocoded","first_year":"2015-16","last_year":"2024-25"},"series":{"attendance_inperson_k8_all":{"y":["2020-21"],"v":[0.936],"st":["ok"],"n":[195.0]},"attendance_k3_all":{"y":["2018-19"],"v":[0.925],"st":["ok"],"n":[230.0]},"attendance_k8_all":{"y":["2019-20","2020-21","2021-22","2022-23","2023-24","2024-25"],"v":[0.935,0.921,0.913,0.911,0.92,0.926],"st":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"],"n":[274.0,291.0,304.0,302.0,305.0,290.0],"c":[null,null,null,null,0.891,0.897]},"attendance_remote_k8_all":{"y":["2020-21"],"v":[0.917],"st":["ok"],"n":[288.0]},"chronic_absent_all":{"y":["2015-16","2016-17","2017-18","2018-19"],"v":[0.72,0.638,0.713,0.729],"st":["ok","ok","ok","ok"],"n":[75.0,105.0,171.0,225.0],"s":[null,2.16,2.75,3.14],"b":[null,"below","below","above"]},"chronic_absent_ems_all":{"y":["2019-20","2020-21","2021-22","2022-23","2023-24","2024-25"],"v":[0.784,0.713,0.652,0.652,0.681,0.718],"st":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"],"n":[269.0,282.0,296.0,293.0,298.0,287.0],"c":[null,null,null,0.634,0.661,0.687],"s":[null,null,null,3.12,3.41,3.65],"b":[null,null,null,"above","above","above"]},"chronic_absent_ems_allea":{"y":["2019-20","2020-21","2021-22","2022-23","2023-24","2024-25"],"v":[0.645,0.659,0.706,0.784,0.745,0.731],"st":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"],"n":[31